      <transcript>BILDAΓUCILA-</transcript>
      <definition>[= bildaucila-] v.i. To flatter, fawn, cringe, wheedle; to toady.</definition>
      <page>104</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠡᠭᠡᠳᠦᠰ ᠢ ᠪᠢᠯᠳᠠᠭᠣᠴᠢᠯᠠᠨ ᠳᠣᠤᠷᠠᠳᠤᠰ ᠢ ᠳᠠᠷᠤᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>degedys i --n douradus i darulaxu</transcript>
          <definition>To fawn before one's superiors and trample on one's inferiors.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
